{"title":"A Dragonslayer’s Peerless Regression","synopsis":"Zeke Draker adalah orang pertama dari keturunan langsung keluarga Dragon Slayer yang gagal untuk awakening Memiliki bakat sebagai Healer alihalih Swordsman dia diusir oleh keluarganya Saat berjuang untuk bertambah kuat Zeke menemui akhir yang tragis\nDi saatsaat kematiannya muncul katakata misterius di depan matanya\nJiwa dari sesosok Elder Dragon terukir dalam tekad dia yang melawan\nKekuatan yang mutlak dan dijanjikan diaktifkan Saat dia tersadar dia menyadari bahwa dirinya berada di keluarga Dragon Slayer yang telah membuangnya 20 tahun sebelumnya\nJika aku bisa menjadi kuat aku akan memanfaatkan hal apapun Dilengkapi dengan kekuatan immortal legenda dari seorang Dragon Slayer dengan kelasnya sendiri dimulai.","alternative_title":"용살자의 클래스가 다른 회귀","author":"hectopascal","artist":"hectopascal","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"f8ef0c5f-266b-4c32-9d3c-1802596b374e","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"id":"50497313-3c8f-4416-aa6a-95b6fb3a3abd","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"adec0577-ff03-45bd-a65a-1a9e3dc4bb42","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"8ad7bd65-8f1c-42e4-88ce-c5ce18a933aa","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"id":"401d9c64-5c9f-47ca-9f22-6ba35e85c3e9","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"id":"d7d6a693-5df3-43d6-a504-8c49586b4eaf","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"f8fe8b81-0e2d-412d-913c-13859405986f","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-06-15","images":[]},{"id":"af8d216f-ffff-4be2-ae6c-c3edca892b02","number":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"id":"a7c16797-a694-45b9-b553-ce8ed728649e","number":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"id":"35488485-59e7-4110-b7de-181bb4ff6ee5","number":"86","ti